\subsection{DL Sum Rate vs. SNR}
In this part, we evaluate the DL sum-rate of different feedback schemes under various SNR. The results of MRT and ZF precoding are shown in Fig. \ref{fig:DL_MRT_snr} and Fig. \ref{fig:DL_ZF_snr}, respectively.

