        Since $\rect{\skel^-}(\mu)$ is biconnected and since $\rect{H} \setminus \rect{e}_{\rho_i}(\mu)$ has no bends, by \cref{th:RN03} $\rect{\skel^-}(\mu)$ is a good plane graph.
