\multicolumn{6}{c}{Flicker Frequencies \( F_i \) (Hz)} \\ 
\hline
0.5 & 3.5 & 6.5 & 10 & 14 & 20 \\ \hline
1 & 4 & 7 & 10.5 & 15 & 21 \\ \hline
1.5 & 4.5 & 7.5 & 11 & 16 & 22 \\ \hline
