Overall, semantic-behavior metrics reveal a safety trade-off: DeepSeek models are structurally robust against some jailbreaks yet more prone to harmful outputs, whereas GPT-4 and GPT-4 Turbo maintain tighter safety boundaries, likely because of stronger alignment and broader-scale safety tuning.

