As shown in Figure~\ref{fig:mamujoco_exp} and~\ref{fig:bidexhands_exp}, DIMA exhibits rapid and consistent policy convergence across all chosen MAMuJoCo and Bi-DexHands tasks, while other model-based baselines fail to demonstrate such stable learning behavior.
