|f(\rho)-f(\rho^*)| \leq \Delta_{f(\Psi)} ||\rho(\mathbf{s}_0) - \rho^*(\mathbf{s}_0)||.
$$
Then, from \textbf{Definition} \ref{def:theta_s} we have
$$
0 \leq ||\rho(\mathbf{s}_0) - \rho^*(\mathbf{s}_0)|| \leq \Delta_{\Psi}.
$$
Therefore, $|f(\rho)-f(\rho^*)| \leq       \Delta_{f(\Psi)} \Delta_{\Psi}$, Eq. (\ref{eq:fitgap2}) is proven.  
